TEMPLATE 1
# A playable first-person character, three shootable targets, a game mode and a viewmodel -- five
# Aver Node graphs, one map, one CC0 mesh, and no C# anywhere. Verify that last claim with
# `find . -name '*.cs'` in a project made from this and expect nothing back.
#
# See Content/README.md for what each file does and what this template deliberately does not do yet.
# That file is copied into every project scaffolded from here, so its owner finds it too.
NAME First Person
DESCRIPTION A playable first-person character with a gun, three scorable targets and a game mode -- no C# anywhere.
STARTMAP Maps/Default.ocmap
# The new project's default GameMode (GAME.MODE): the template's rules, character and gun.
GAMEMODE AN_FPRules
